    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep Me Gifted \u2013 Start Your Own Shop, Package, Sell, and Grow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/a18c4f2fe0704567bfb86c2a69895305.poster.avif?t=1755170978\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/a18c4f2fe0704567bfb86c2a69895305.webm?t=1755170978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/a18c4f2fe0704567bfb86c2a69895305.mp4?t=1755170978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep Me Gifted, A fun, engaging and sometimes a little chaotic simulation experience is now available on STEAM!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/7bae1ab371a5decb3d7b5ba4a06614e0.poster.avif?t=1755170978\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/7bae1ab371a5decb3d7b5ba4a06614e0.webm?t=1755170978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/7bae1ab371a5decb3d7b5ba4a06614e0.mp4?t=1755170978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey with a small gift shop and grow your business step by step. In <strong>Keep Me Gifted</strong>, you begin by naming your store, stocking your shelves with charming items, setting prices, and serving customers. Your goal is to maximize customer satisfaction, increase sales, and build a successful business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/abe759252b8397f2b88848be2a9e684b.poster.avif?t=1755170978\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/abe759252b8397f2b88848be2a9e684b.webm?t=1755170978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/abe759252b8397f2b88848be2a9e684b.mp4?t=1755170978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go outside and do your errands. Restock your shop by going to Bulk Buy, Deliver your online orders to the Post Office and if the going gets tough your friendly neighbourhood Loanshark will always be there to \u201chelp\u201d you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/81d4af7535fcf779d734578fb8983eaa.poster.avif?t=1755170978\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/81d4af7535fcf779d734578fb8983eaa.webm?t=1755170978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/81d4af7535fcf779d734578fb8983eaa.mp4?t=1755170978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made a mistake while packing? No worries. You can open the box with a utility knife and fix the order before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/3f70800d94ea805a5457bb634fe3d4ea.poster.avif?t=1755170978\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/3f70800d94ea805a5457bb634fe3d4ea.webm?t=1755170978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/3f70800d94ea805a5457bb634fe3d4ea.mp4?t=1755170978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add some fun to your packages with <strong>stickers</strong> and <strong>decorations</strong> to bring a smile to your customers\u2019 faces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/67871e85fc3632025e780780a36b95f1.poster.avif?t=1755170978\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/67871e85fc3632025e780780a36b95f1.webm?t=1755170978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/67871e85fc3632025e780780a36b95f1.mp4?t=1755170978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers can pay with either <strong>cash</strong> or <strong>card</strong>, but don\u2019t forget to collect the payment and return the correct change. Even small mistakes can affect customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/d414733286d54589761607082c2a3ff1.poster.avif?t=1755170978\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/d414733286d54589761607082c2a3ff1.webm?t=1755170978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/d414733286d54589761607082c2a3ff1.mp4?t=1755170978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core of the game is to grow your shop using smart sales strategies, earn high ratings through positive customer reviews, and become a successful small business owner. With its fun packaging mechanics, business simulation elements, and daily tasks, <strong>Keep Me Gifted</strong> offers a delightful and rewarding experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/c30c28057468b831ba7434dc6b8d52dd.poster.avif?t=1755170978\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/c30c28057468b831ba7434dc6b8d52dd.webm?t=1755170978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/c30c28057468b831ba7434dc6b8d52dd.mp4?t=1755170978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone, meet Madame Bouvier! Our towns very own fortune-teller and witch! She has a few screws loose (as any fortuneteller should\u2026) but she still gets the job done! Wait for her to visit your shops and draw your card! &quot;What will i get\u201d you may ask? Only she and her chart knows. She is a little spacey sometimes, but i will tell you this much, every benevolent card has a counterpart ranging from Tax evasion charms to double the rent curses. So choose wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/de768366be520e4e99dc9935e22fd56e.poster.avif?t=1755170978\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/de768366be520e4e99dc9935e22fd56e.webm?t=1755170978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/de768366be520e4e99dc9935e22fd56e.mp4?t=1755170978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep Me Gifted</strong> is both fun and strategic. Bring out your inner shopkeeper, break sales records, and <strong>build your very own gift shop empire.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/8d5429c124f5dbcdf9c18fb4b6a65279.avif?t=1755170978\" data-has-big width=800 height=413 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep Me Gifted \u2013 Start Your Own Shop, Package, Sell, and Grow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/a18c4f2fe0704567bfb86c2a69895305.poster.avif?t=1755170978\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/a18c4f2fe0704567bfb86c2a69895305.webm?t=1755170978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/a18c4f2fe0704567bfb86c2a69895305.mp4?t=1755170978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep Me Gifted, A fun, engaging and sometimes a little chaotic simulation experience is now available on STEAM!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/7bae1ab371a5decb3d7b5ba4a06614e0.poster.avif?t=1755170978\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/7bae1ab371a5decb3d7b5ba4a06614e0.webm?t=1755170978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/7bae1ab371a5decb3d7b5ba4a06614e0.mp4?t=1755170978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey with a small gift shop and grow your business step by step. In <strong>Keep Me Gifted</strong>, you begin by naming your store, stocking your shelves with charming items, setting prices, and serving customers. Your goal is to maximize customer satisfaction, increase sales, and build a successful business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p clas